---
description: >-
  Baseline daily-tick gantt chart (tickInterval 1day, excludes
  weekends) with axis labels at the default bottom position — the
  counterpart to the sibling fixture that adds topAxis: true for the
  same content.
---
gantt
  title A Gantt Diagram
  dateFormat   YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat   %m-%d
  tickInterval 1day
  excludes     weekends

  section Section
  A task           : a1, 2022-10-01, 30d
  Another task     : after a1, 20d
  section Another
  Task in sec      : 2022-10-20, 12d
  another task     : 24d
